WEBVTT

00:24:59.958 --> 00:25:03.143
Negotiating is not
the first phase of making a deal.

00:25:03.167 --> 00:25:04.893
It's the third.

00:25:04.917 --> 00:25:08.601
The first two are preparation
and information exchange.

00:25:08.625 --> 00:25:10.684
You know now from Grace
and Jason's stories

00:25:10.708 --> 00:25:14.351
why it's so valuable
to understand the other party's needs.

00:25:14.375 --> 00:25:16.250
This is about how to actually do that.

00:25:17.417 --> 00:25:21.018
So I prepared for Cinnabon
by coming up with an unusual request.

00:25:21.042 --> 00:25:25.476
I wanted to show I wasn't selfish
by asking on behalf of my wife, Allison,

00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:26.809
though when I got home,

00:25:26.833 --> 00:25:29.559
I found out she had
no interest in a Cinnataco.

00:25:29.583 --> 00:25:32.101
I also figured that sharing
some personal information